	keywords = {Blast furnaces; Carbon capture and utilization; Carbon sequestration; Cement manufacture; Portland cement; Slags; Adjustment mechanisms; Attributional life cycle assessment; Carbon border adjustment mechanism; Consequential life cycle assessment; Consequential life-cycle assessment; Environmental benefits; Granulated blast furnace slag; Granulated blast-furnace slags; Recycling allocation; Steel byproduct; Slag cement},
