	keywords = {Belgium; Flanders; Brickmaking; Cements; Climate change; Kilns; Phosphorus; Recovery; Sensitivity analysis; Uncertainty analysis; Waste incineration; Wastewater treatment; phosphorus; polymer; struvite; End-uses; Global sensitivity analysis; Phosphate rocks; Phosphorus recovery; Prospective life cycle assessment, global sensitivity analyse; Prospectives; Sludge treatment; Struvite recoveries; Wastewater sludge; Wastewater sludge treatment; European Union; life cycle analysis; phosphorus; sensitivity analysis; sludge; struvite; wastewater treatment; acidification; Article; climate change; comparative study; controlled study; environmental policy; incineration; land application; land use; life cycle assessment; municipal solid waste; prospective study; recycling; sensitivity analysis; sludge; sludge dewatering; sludge treatment; waste valorization; waste water treatment plant; wastewater; Life cycle},
